+ *          |       -                           | fusion data
+ *  0x09    | BNO055_OPERATION_MODE_COMPASS     | Reads accel, mag data
+ *   -      |       -                           | and fusion data
+ *  0x0A    | BNO055_OPERATION_MODE_M4G         | Reads accel, mag data
+ *    -     |       -                           | and fusion data
+ *  0x0B    | BNO055_OPERATION_MODE_NDOF_FMC_OFF| Nine degrees of freedom with
+ *   -      |       -                           | fast magnetic calibration
